# Read by Cloudflare (Workers assets) from the root of dist/. No Content-Security-Policy yet:
# index.html carries an inline theme script and the API origin comes from VITE_API_BASE, so a policy
# has to be written against the deployed hosts and tried in a browser first.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
